          Standards token/session hygiene without weakening contracts, graph
          currency, or verification.
        </Purpose>
        <Inputs>
          <Input>
            <Name>standards</Name>
            <Type>AI Standards 1.6.0 agent-usage-hygiene + session-hygiene</Type>
          </Input>
          <Input>
            <Name>graceArtifacts</Name>
